# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android/tunnel

## Purpose
Owns Android tunnel/VPN lifecycle integration for routing LumiNet traffic through platform networking facilities.

## Contents
Contains Kotlin/Java tunnel controllers, lifecycle helpers, and platform adapters associated with Android VPN operation.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Interacts with Android VPN/network APIs and shared/native networking contracts; consumed by application service and connection flows.

## Invariants
Tunnel ownership is singular and lifecycle-aware, cancellation/teardown releases platform resources, and route/DNS mutation must be applied and rolled back consistently.